t read)","unit":"ratio","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/pmbstyle-L2Solo/src/GameServer/Bot/Economy/BotEconomyPricing.js:7"}],"best_idea":"A seller lists no more units than funded demand can absorb, at a price that undercuts the cheapest rival by 2 percent but never below 60 percent of the reference, and surplus goes to a fixed NPC sink at half of base price.","decision":"adapt","decision_why":"The listing gate (funded demand minus supply as the cap, undercut versus floor, NPC sink at half base) suits AI merchants and surplus-loot clearing under one currency. Reject the one-way learned multiplier (down 5 per unsold expiry, floor 50, never raised) and the per-seller seeded spread, since they make the price depend on history or character id.","decision_status":"proposed","acceptance":"A server test with 6 funded units of demand and no supply lets a seller holding 10 units list exactly 6; with a rival ask of 90 and 5 units already listed, the same seller lists exactly 1 unit at no more than floor(90 x 0.98) = 88, and lists nothing when its 60 percent floor is above 88."}
